  "result": {
    "engine": "knitr",
    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Getting started with aplsr\"\nvignette: >\n  %\\VignetteIndexEntry{Getting started with aplsr}\n  %\\VignetteEngine{quarto::html}\n  %\\VignetteEncoding{UTF-8}\nformat: html\n---\n\n\n\n## Why this package exists\n\nThe AP-LS website is a Quarto site, and its pages shared a single\nscript, `assets/apls_functions.R`, that every page loaded with `source()`. As the\nsite grew, the same helpers were copied into individual pages, and the copies\ndrifted apart. `aplsr` collects those helpers in one place so a page can load\nthem with `library(aplsr)` and call one tested function on every page.\n\nThe package covers three kinds of helper: tables of award recipients, small\nHTML/UI components, and a data-frame utility.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nlibrary(aplsr)\n```\n:::\n\n\n## Award tables\n\nEach award page reads a CSV of past recipients and renders it with one function.\n`awards_table()` handles the common case of one or more named recipients per\nyear.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nsaleem <- data.frame(\n  year = c(2026, 2026, 2025),\n  name = c(\"Alicia Nijdam-Jones\", \"Laura Smalarz\", \"Miko Wilford\")\n)\nawards_table(saleem)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div style=\"max-width: 620px;\">\n<div class=\"reactable html-widget html-fill-item\" data-react-ssr id=\"htmlwidget-4140c99912c5da60b914\" style=\"width:auto;height:auto;\"><div class=\"Reactable ReactTable reactable-14f48o3\"><div class=\"rt-table reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"table\"><div class=\"rt-thead\" role=\"rowgroup\" style=\"min-width:200px\"><div class=\"rt-tr rt-tr-header\" role=\"row\" style=\"flex:1 0 auto;min-width:200px\"><div class=\"rt-th rt-align-left reactable-1v4qyn9\" role=\"columnheader\" style=\"position:relative;flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px;max-width:110px\"><div class=\"rt-th-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">Year</div></div><div class=\"rt-th rt-align-left reactable-1v4qyn9\" role=\"columnheader\" style=\"position:relative;flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px\"><div class=\"rt-th-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">Recipient</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rt-tbody\" role=\"rowgroup\" style=\"min-width:200px\"><div class=\"rt-tr-group\"><div class=\"rt-tr rt-tr-highlight reactable-x6awnz\" role=\"row\" style=\"flex:1 0 auto;min-width:200px\"><div class=\"rt-td rt-align-left rt-valign-center reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"cell\" style=\"flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px;max-width:110px;font-weight:700;color:#1B3264;font-size:1.05rem\"><div class=\"rt-td-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">2026</div></div><div class=\"rt-td rt-align-left rt-valign-center reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"cell\" style=\"flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px;font-weight:600;color:#1f2937\"><div class=\"rt-td-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">Laura Smalarz</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rt-tr-group\"><div class=\"rt-tr rt-tr-highlight reactable-x6awnz\" role=\"row\" style=\"flex:1 0 auto;min-width:200px\"><div class=\"rt-td rt-align-left rt-valign-center reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"cell\" style=\"flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px;max-width:110px;font-weight:700;color:#1B3264;font-size:1.05rem\"><div class=\"rt-td-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">2026</div></div><div class=\"rt-td rt-align-left rt-valign-center reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"cell\" style=\"flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px;font-weight:600;color:#1f2937\"><div class=\"rt-td-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">Alicia Nijdam-Jones</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rt-tr-group\"><div class=\"rt-tr rt-tr-highlight reactable-x6awnz\" role=\"row\" style=\"flex:1 0 auto;min-width:200px\"><div class=\"rt-td rt-align-left rt-valign-center reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"cell\" style=\"flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px;max-width:110px;font-weight:700;color:#1B3264;font-size:1.05rem\"><div class=\"rt-td-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">2025</div></div><div class=\"rt-td rt-align-left rt-valign-center reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"cell\" style=\"flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px;font-weight:600;color:#1f2937\"><div class=\"rt-td-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">Miko Wilford</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rt-no-data\" aria-live=\"assertive\"></div></div></div></div></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-4140c99912c5da60b914\">{\"x\":{\"tag\":{\"name\":\"Reactable\",\"attribs\":{\"data\":{\"year\":[2026,2026,2025],\"name\":[\"Alicia Nijdam-Jones\",\"Laura Smalarz\",\"Miko Wilford\"]},\"columns\":[{\"id\":\"year\",\"name\":\"Year\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"align\":\"left\",\"vAlign\":\"center\",\"maxWidth\":110,\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":700,\"color\":\"#1B3264\",\"fontSize\":\"1.05rem\"}},{\"id\":\"name\",\"name\":\"Recipient\",\"type\":\"character\",\"align\":\"left\",\"vAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":600,\"color\":\"#1f2937\"}}],\"sortable\":false,\"defaultSorted\":[{\"id\":\"year\",\"desc\":true}],\"defaultPageSize\":60,\"highlight\":true,\"theme\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"transparent\",\"borderColor\":\"rgba(0,0,0,0.08)\",\"highlightColor\":\"rgba(27,50,100,0.06)\",\"cellPadding\":\"10px 14px\",\"style\":{\"fontFamily\":\"inherit\"},\"headerStyle\":{\"color\":\"#1B3264\",\"fontWeight\":600,\"borderBottom\":\"2px solid #1B3264\",\"paddingBottom\":\"6px\"}},\"dataKey\":\"72f48b116009443c28b7812d0568b4c5\"},\"children\":[]},\"class\":\"reactR_markup\"},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\nPass `detail` to add a muted second column, for example an award type or a\nmentor:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nteaching <- data.frame(\n  year = c(2026, 2026),\n  name = c(\"Deah Quinlivan\", \"Cassandra Bailey\"),\n  note = c(\"Outstanding Teaching & Mentoring\", \"Early Career Teaching & Mentoring\")\n)\nawards_table(teaching, detail = \"note\")\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div style=\"max-width: 620px;\">\n<div class=\"reactable html-widget html-fill-item\" data-react-ssr id=\"htmlwidget-b6a9827be0ff5fb08f58\" style=\"width:auto;height:auto;\"><div class=\"Reactable ReactTable reactable-14f48o3\"><div class=\"rt-table reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"table\"><div class=\"rt-thead\" role=\"rowgroup\" style=\"min-width:300px\"><div class=\"rt-tr rt-tr-header\" role=\"row\" style=\"flex:1 0 auto;min-width:300px\"><div class=\"rt-th rt-align-left reactable-1v4qyn9\" role=\"columnheader\" style=\"position:relative;flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px;max-width:110px\"><div class=\"rt-th-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">Year</div></div><div class=\"rt-th rt-align-left reactable-1v4qyn9\" role=\"columnheader\" style=\"position:relative;flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px\"><div class=\"rt-th-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">Recipient</div></div><div class=\"rt-th rt-align-left reactable-1v4qyn9\" role=\"columnheader\" style=\"position:relative;flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px\"><div class=\"rt-th-inner reactable-1h1twwx\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rt-tbody\" role=\"rowgroup\" style=\"min-width:300px\"><div class=\"rt-tr-group\"><div class=\"rt-tr rt-tr-highlight reactable-x6awnz\" role=\"row\" style=\"flex:1 0 auto;min-width:300px\"><div class=\"rt-td rt-align-left rt-valign-center reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"cell\" style=\"flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px;max-width:110px;font-weight:700;color:#1B3264;font-size:1.05rem\"><div class=\"rt-td-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">2026</div></div><div class=\"rt-td rt-align-left rt-valign-center reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"cell\" style=\"flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px;font-weight:600;color:#1f2937\"><div class=\"rt-td-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">Cassandra Bailey</div></div><div class=\"rt-td rt-align-left rt-valign-center reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"cell\" style=\"flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px;color:#6c757d\"><div class=\"rt-td-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">Early Career Teaching &amp; Mentoring</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rt-tr-group\"><div class=\"rt-tr rt-tr-highlight reactable-x6awnz\" role=\"row\" style=\"flex:1 0 auto;min-width:300px\"><div class=\"rt-td rt-align-left rt-valign-center reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"cell\" style=\"flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px;max-width:110px;font-weight:700;color:#1B3264;font-size:1.05rem\"><div class=\"rt-td-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">2026</div></div><div class=\"rt-td rt-align-left rt-valign-center reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"cell\" style=\"flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px;font-weight:600;color:#1f2937\"><div class=\"rt-td-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">Deah Quinlivan</div></div><div class=\"rt-td rt-align-left rt-valign-center reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"cell\" style=\"flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px;color:#6c757d\"><div class=\"rt-td-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">Outstanding Teaching &amp; Mentoring</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rt-no-data\" aria-live=\"assertive\"></div></div></div></div></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-b6a9827be0ff5fb08f58\">{\"x\":{\"tag\":{\"name\":\"Reactable\",\"attribs\":{\"data\":{\"year\":[2026,2026],\"name\":[\"Deah Quinlivan\",\"Cassandra Bailey\"],\"note\":[\"Outstanding Teaching & Mentoring\",\"Early Career Teaching & Mentoring\"]},\"columns\":[{\"id\":\"year\",\"name\":\"Year\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"align\":\"left\",\"vAlign\":\"center\",\"maxWidth\":110,\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":700,\"color\":\"#1B3264\",\"fontSize\":\"1.05rem\"}},{\"id\":\"name\",\"name\":\"Recipient\",\"type\":\"character\",\"align\":\"left\",\"vAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":600,\"color\":\"#1f2937\"}},{\"id\":\"note\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"character\",\"align\":\"left\",\"vAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#6c757d\"}}],\"sortable\":false,\"defaultSorted\":[{\"id\":\"year\",\"desc\":true}],\"defaultPageSize\":60,\"highlight\":true,\"theme\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"transparent\",\"borderColor\":\"rgba(0,0,0,0.08)\",\"highlightColor\":\"rgba(27,50,100,0.06)\",\"cellPadding\":\"10px 14px\",\"style\":{\"fontFamily\":\"inherit\"},\"headerStyle\":{\"color\":\"#1B3264\",\"fontWeight\":600,\"borderBottom\":\"2px solid #1B3264\",\"paddingBottom\":\"6px\"}},\"dataKey\":\"8987262bceebd2748d1a1f51e81a7e11\"},\"children\":[]},\"class\":\"reactR_markup\"},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\nTwo awards have their own layout. `book_awards_table()` shows the year, author,\nand a linked title, and `dissertation_table()` lays out first, second, and third\nplace across columns.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nbooks <- data.frame(\n  year = \"2026\",\n  author = \"David DeMatteo & Kelly C. Scherr (Eds.)\",\n  title = \"The Oxford Handbook of Psychology and Law\",\n  url = \"https://doi.org/10.1093/oxfordhb/9780197649138.001.0001\",\n  img = \"\"\n)\nbook_awards_table(books)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div style=\"max-width: 860px;\">\n<div class=\"reactable html-widget html-fill-item\" data-react-ssr id=\"htmlwidget-6bc2ae6f3677d1108e39\" style=\"width:auto;height:auto;\"><div class=\"Reactable ReactTable reactable-14f48o3\"><div class=\"rt-table reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"table\"><div class=\"rt-thead\" role=\"rowgroup\" style=\"min-width:290px\"><div class=\"rt-tr rt-tr-header\" role=\"row\" style=\"flex:1 0 auto;min-width:290px\"><div class=\"rt-th rt-align-left reactable-1v4qyn9\" role=\"columnheader\" style=\"position:relative;flex:0 0 auto;min-width:90px;width:90px;max-width:90px\"><div class=\"rt-th-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">Year</div></div><div class=\"rt-th rt-align-left reactable-1v4qyn9\" role=\"columnheader\" style=\"position:relative;flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px;max-width:230px\"><div class=\"rt-th-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">Author</div></div><div class=\"rt-th rt-align-left reactable-1v4qyn9\" role=\"columnheader\" style=\"position:relative;flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px\"><div class=\"rt-th-inner reactable-1h1twwx\"><div class=\"rt-text-content\">Title</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rt-tbody\" role=\"rowgroup\" style=\"min-width:290px\"><div class=\"rt-tr-group\"><div class=\"rt-tr rt-tr-highlight reactable-x6awnz\" role=\"row\" style=\"flex:1 0 auto;min-width:290px\"><div class=\"rt-td rt-align-left rt-valign-center reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"cell\" style=\"flex:0 0 auto;min-width:90px;width:90px;max-width:90px;font-weight:700;color:#1B3264\"><div class=\"rt-td-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">2026</div></div><div class=\"rt-td rt-align-left rt-valign-center reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"cell\" style=\"flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px;max-width:230px;font-weight:600;color:#1f2937\"><div class=\"rt-td-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">David DeMatteo &amp; Kelly C. Scherr (Eds.)</div></div><div class=\"rt-td rt-align-left rt-valign-center reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"cell\" style=\"flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px\"><div class=\"rt-td-inner reactable-1h1twwx\"><div class=\"rt-text-content\" style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1093/oxfordhb/9780197649138.001.0001\" target=\"_blank\">The Oxford Handbook of Psychology and Law</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rt-no-data\" aria-live=\"assertive\"></div></div></div></div></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-6bc2ae6f3677d1108e39\">{\"x\":{\"tag\":{\"name\":\"Reactable\",\"attribs\":{\"data\":{\"year\":[\"2026\"],\"author\":[\"David DeMatteo & Kelly C. Scherr (Eds.)\"],\"title\":[\"The Oxford Handbook of Psychology and Law\"],\"url\":[\"https://doi.org/10.1093/oxfordhb/9780197649138.001.0001\"],\"img\":[\"\"]},\"columns\":[{\"id\":\"year\",\"name\":\"Year\",\"type\":\"character\",\"align\":\"left\",\"vAlign\":\"center\",\"maxWidth\":90,\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":700,\"color\":\"#1B3264\"}},{\"id\":\"author\",\"name\":\"Author\",\"type\":\"character\",\"align\":\"left\",\"vAlign\":\"center\",\"maxWidth\":230,\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":600,\"color\":\"#1f2937\"}},{\"id\":\"title\",\"name\":\"Title\",\"type\":\"character\",\"align\":\"left\",\"vAlign\":\"center\",\"cell\":[\"<a href=\\\"https://doi.org/10.1093/oxfordhb/9780197649138.001.0001\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">The Oxford Handbook of Psychology and Law<\\/a>\"],\"html\":true},{\"id\":\"url\",\"name\":\"url\",\"type\":\"character\",\"align\":\"left\",\"vAlign\":\"center\",\"show\":false},{\"id\":\"img\",\"name\":\"img\",\"type\":\"character\",\"align\":\"left\",\"vAlign\":\"center\",\"show\":false}],\"sortable\":false,\"defaultSorted\":[{\"id\":\"year\",\"desc\":true}],\"defaultPageSize\":20,\"highlight\":true,\"theme\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"transparent\",\"borderColor\":\"rgba(0,0,0,0.08)\",\"highlightColor\":\"rgba(27,50,100,0.06)\",\"cellPadding\":\"10px 14px\",\"style\":{\"fontFamily\":\"inherit\"},\"headerStyle\":{\"color\":\"#1B3264\",\"fontWeight\":600,\"borderBottom\":\"2px solid #1B3264\",\"paddingBottom\":\"6px\"}},\"dataKey\":\"cc8cd7b45c2e67d97a7394b2c8e190d4\"},\"children\":[]},\"class\":\"reactR_markup\"},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\ndiss <- data.frame(\n  year = 2026,\n  first = \"Sandy S. Xie\",\n  second = \"Samantha Rea Bean\",\n  third = \"Luca Adolfo Tiberi\"\n)\ndissertation_table(diss)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div style=\"max-width: 960px;\">\n<div class=\"reactable html-widget html-fill-item\" data-react-ssr id=\"htmlwidget-483e39a30e18e19808ee\" style=\"width:auto;height:auto;\"><div class=\"Reactable ReactTable reactable-14f48o3\"><div class=\"rt-table reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"table\"><div class=\"rt-thead\" role=\"rowgroup\" style=\"min-width:380px\"><div class=\"rt-tr rt-tr-header\" role=\"row\" style=\"flex:1 0 auto;min-width:380px\"><div class=\"rt-th rt-align-left reactable-1v4qyn9\" role=\"columnheader\" style=\"position:relative;flex:80 0 auto;min-width:80px;width:80px;max-width:110px\"><div class=\"rt-th-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">Year</div></div><div class=\"rt-th rt-align-left reactable-1v4qyn9\" role=\"columnheader\" style=\"position:relative;flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px\"><div class=\"rt-th-inner reactable-1h1twwx\"><div class=\"rt-text-content\">1st place</div></div></div><div class=\"rt-th rt-align-left reactable-1v4qyn9\" role=\"columnheader\" style=\"position:relative;flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px\"><div class=\"rt-th-inner reactable-1h1twwx\"><div class=\"rt-text-content\">2nd place</div></div></div><div class=\"rt-th rt-align-left reactable-1v4qyn9\" role=\"columnheader\" style=\"position:relative;flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px\"><div class=\"rt-th-inner reactable-1h1twwx\"><div class=\"rt-text-content\">3rd place</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rt-tbody\" role=\"rowgroup\" style=\"min-width:380px\"><div class=\"rt-tr-group\"><div class=\"rt-tr rt-tr-highlight reactable-x6awnz\" role=\"row\" style=\"flex:1 0 auto;min-width:380px\"><div class=\"rt-td rt-align-left rt-valign-center reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"cell\" style=\"flex:80 0 auto;min-width:80px;width:80px;max-width:110px;font-weight:700;color:#1B3264\"><div class=\"rt-td-inner reactable-1h1twwx\">2026</div></div><div class=\"rt-td rt-align-left rt-valign-center reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"cell\" style=\"flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px\"><div class=\"rt-td-inner reactable-1h1twwx\"><div class=\"rt-text-content\" style=\"display:inline\">Sandy S. Xie</div></div></div><div class=\"rt-td rt-align-left rt-valign-center reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"cell\" style=\"flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px\"><div class=\"rt-td-inner reactable-1h1twwx\"><div class=\"rt-text-content\" style=\"display:inline\">Samantha Rea Bean</div></div></div><div class=\"rt-td rt-align-left rt-valign-center reactable-13rl8q5\" role=\"cell\" style=\"flex:100 0 auto;min-width:100px;width:100px\"><div class=\"rt-td-inner reactable-1h1twwx\"><div class=\"rt-text-content\" style=\"display:inline\">Luca Adolfo Tiberi</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rt-no-data\" aria-live=\"assertive\"></div></div></div></div></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-483e39a30e18e19808ee\">{\"x\":{\"tag\":{\"name\":\"Reactable\",\"attribs\":{\"data\":{\"year\":[2026],\"first\":[\"Sandy S. Xie\"],\"second\":[\"Samantha Rea Bean\"],\"third\":[\"Luca Adolfo Tiberi\"]},\"columns\":[{\"id\":\"year\",\"name\":\"Year\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"align\":\"left\",\"vAlign\":\"center\",\"minWidth\":80,\"maxWidth\":110,\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":700,\"color\":\"#1B3264\"}},{\"id\":\"first\",\"name\":\"1st place\",\"type\":\"character\",\"align\":\"left\",\"vAlign\":\"center\",\"html\":true},{\"id\":\"second\",\"name\":\"2nd place\",\"type\":\"character\",\"align\":\"left\",\"vAlign\":\"center\",\"html\":true},{\"id\":\"third\",\"name\":\"3rd place\",\"type\":\"character\",\"align\":\"left\",\"vAlign\":\"center\",\"html\":true}],\"sortable\":false,\"defaultSorted\":[{\"id\":\"year\",\"desc\":true}],\"defaultPageSize\":60,\"highlight\":true,\"theme\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"transparent\",\"borderColor\":\"rgba(0,0,0,0.08)\",\"highlightColor\":\"rgba(27,50,100,0.06)\",\"cellPadding\":\"10px 14px\",\"style\":{\"fontFamily\":\"inherit\"},\"headerStyle\":{\"color\":\"#1B3264\",\"fontWeight\":600,\"borderBottom\":\"2px solid #1B3264\",\"paddingBottom\":\"6px\"}},\"dataKey\":\"fd3015421b238736bdbe4ea031c3b1c6\"},\"children\":[]},\"class\":\"reactR_markup\"},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\nAll three share one look through `apls_table_theme()`, so a change there updates\nevery award page at once.\n\n## HTML and UI helpers\n\n`carousel()` builds a Bootstrap image carousel from a list of slides:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nslides <- list(\n  list(caption = \"2026 conference\", image = \"img/2026.jpg\", link = \"conferences/\")\n)\ncarousel(\"gallery\", duration = 5000, items = slides)\n```\n:::\n\n\n`create_inline_object()` returns an inline icon and link, and\n`generate_info_bar()` returns an info-bar block; both return HTML strings you can\ndrop into a page with `cat()` or an inline R expression.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\ncreate_inline_object(\"envelope\", \"Email the office\", \"mailto:office@ap-ls.org\")\n#> [1] \"<span class=\\\"inline-object\\\"><i class=\\\"fa fa-envelope\\\"></i><a href=\\\"mailto:office@ap-ls.org\\\">Email the office</a></span>\"\n```\n:::\n\n\n## Using a function on a page\n\nA page chunk reads its data and calls the matching function:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nlibrary(aplsr)\n\ndata <- read.csv(\"../data/saleem-shah.csv\")\nawards_table(data, name = \"name\")\n```\n:::\n\n\nThe recipient CSVs themselves are refreshed from the awards Google Sheet by the\nsite's `awards/_update-awards.R` script, which is separate from this package.\n",
